Summary for Your Presentation

We protect against SQL injection by using Spring Data JPA's 
built-in parameterized queries. All user input is treated as 
data, not code. We enforce this by never concatenating strings 
to build SQL queries. Additionally, we disable SQL logging in 
production to prevent sensitive data from being exposed.
